### Criar transação simples
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Almoço no restaurante",
  "amount": "85.50",
  "category": "Alimentação",
  "transactionDate": "2026-03-30T12:00:00Z"
}

### Criar transação com parcelamento
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Passagem aérea",
  "amount": "1200.00",
  "installments": 3,
  "category": "Viagem",
  "transactionDate": "2026-03-30T10:00:00Z"
}

### Criar transação parcelada em 6 vezes
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Notebook",
  "amount": "3600.00",
  "installments": 6,
  "category": "Eletrônicos",
  "transactionDate": "2026-03-30T14:00:00Z"
}

### Listar todas as transações
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

@transactionId = abc123
### Buscar transação específica
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Atualizar transação
PUT {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Almoço no novo restaurante",
  "category": "Alimentação - Atualizado"
}

### Deletar transação
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{transactionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

@installmentId = xyz789
### Pagar parcela
POST {{baseUrl}}/installments/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "installmentId": "{{installmentId}}"
}
